      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it would be better to have a struct for the header instead of all this p[pnext++] stuff. The header seems to be a fixed size.\n\nSuggest also using 16 bits for the slave_addr so that if you support 10 bit addressing later you don\u0027t need to modify the header.\n\nYou can also check right at the top here that you have enough bytes for the whole header, which will reduce the number of checks below.",
