        "id": 1000107
      },
      "writtenOn": "2013-05-06T17:02:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "According to Randall if you want to change slave addresses mid-transaction you just specify the 7-bit or 10-bit again.  If you don\u0027t then it\u0027s assumed that the next chunk has the same address as the previous.\n\n...this is another instance of trying to be byte efficient.",
      "parentUuid": "AAAAXn//7wg\u003d",
      "revId": "12290092685a9fa783771a95dadaa944e59d5ae2",
